{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOB","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"約伯記","commonName":"約伯記","title":"約伯記","order":18,"numberOfChapters":42,"sha256":"3aa72174529879f59c9c24a590c7f512dafc69fc78e843aed0f93864112147ea","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":42,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/42.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1068},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["約伯失去健康"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["又有一天，眾天使來朝見耶和華，撒旦也在他們當中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["耶和華問撒旦：「你從哪裡來？」撒旦答道：「我在地上到處遊走。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和華問道：「你注意到我的僕人約伯了嗎？世上沒有人像他那樣純全正直，敬畏我，遠離罪惡。雖然你鼓動我無緣無故地攻擊他、毀滅他，他仍然持守自己的純正。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["撒旦回答說：「人會以皮換皮，為了保全生命，情願捨棄一切。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["倘若你伸手傷害他的骨和肉，他必當面褻瀆你。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和華說：「好吧，他在你手中，但要留他一命。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["於是，撒旦從耶和華面前退去，開始加害約伯，使他從頭到腳長毒瘡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["約伯坐在爐灰中，拿瓦片刮身體。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他的妻子對他說：「你還要持守自己的純正嗎？不如褻瀆上帝，死掉算了！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["但約伯回答說：「你說話像個愚昧的婦人。難道我們只從上帝手裡接受祝福，卻不接受災殃嗎？」約伯遭此不幸，仍沒有犯言語之罪。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["約伯的三個朋友"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["約伯的三個朋友提幔人以利法、書亞人比勒達和拿瑪人瑣法聽到他的不幸遭遇，便各自從家鄉動身，相約一起來探望、安慰他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他們遠遠地看見約伯，幾乎認不出是他，禁不住放聲大哭，各自撕裂外袍，揚起塵土，讓土落在頭上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他們看到約伯極其痛苦，就陪著他在地上坐了七天七夜，沒有對他說一句話。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}